[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22201200_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22201200_01_0010","text":"哈……！　哈……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22201200_01_0020","text":"（咦……\n　走在前面的是……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22201200_01_0030","text":"（回事务所之后，得确认一下日程才行……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22201200_01_0040","text":"（果然是Producer先生……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22201200_01_0050","text":"Producer先──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22201200_01_0060","text":"噼呀……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22201200_01_0070","text":"嗯？　……哎呀，小糸！\n你没事吧！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22201200_01_0080","text":"啊……完、完全没事！\n完全没事──……唔"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22201200_01_0090","text":"……看起来挺疼的，没事吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22201200_01_0100","text":"还是别硬撑比较好\n能坚持到事务所吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22201200_01_0101","text":"Motion"}]
